      source_ref: pi-pr88
    assert_stdout_regex[1]: fail 0
    note: Full suite includes the audit-level combined scalar publisher/subcommand regression with an attested sibling.
close_reason: Combined unresolved scalar commands now fail closed with an audit regression and source-only revert proof; the heredoc finding was disproved by execution.
